{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PROMSGS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310393","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROMSGS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROMSGS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PROMSGS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PROMSGS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the current value of the ABL PROMSGS\nvariable.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROMSGS-function__syntax_GC1A10D2700391\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d455309e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROMSGS-function__idGDN2SM2674725\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PROMSGS</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROMSGS-function__example_GC1A10E2700395\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d455309e122\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nexample uses the PROMSGS function to determine whether the default\nmessage file (promsgs) is in use. If not, it uses the PROMSGS function again\nto display the name of the current message file.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-promsg.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROMSGS-function__idGDN2SN2674729\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IF <strong class=\"ph b\">PROMSGS</strong> = &quot;promsgs&quot; THEN\n  MESSAGE &quot;Using default promsgs file.&quot;.\nELSE \n  MESSAGE &quot;Using&quot; <strong class=\"ph b\">PROMSGS</strong>.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROMSGS-function__see-also_GC1A10F2700402\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d455309e163\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROMSGS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROMSGS-statement.html#PROMSGS-statement\">PROMSGS statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROMPT-FOR-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROMPT-FOR-statement.html\">PROMPT-FOR statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROMSGS-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROMSGS-statement.html\">PROMSGS statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310393","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PROMSGS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROMSGS-function.html","type":"Manual"}